## How We Use Datadog (Day-to-Day)

### 🔍 Monitoring
- Track cluster health, pod restarts, CPU throttling
- Monitor service latency (p95), error rates, and saturation

### 🚨 Alerting
- Alerts on:
  - High latency
  - Error rate spikes
  - Pod crash loops
  - Node pressure
- Alerts routed to Slack / PagerDuty

### 🧪 Incident Response
- Use traces + logs to identify bottlenecks
- Correlate deploy events with performance degradation
- Validate rollback effectiveness

### 📊 Capacity & Cost
- Identify unused or over-provisioned workloads
- Track namespace-level resource usage

